; DIMANGULAR, the Mtext option with a text with <> ([0.8.1-RT3], work #930): before Text, as
; AutoCAD ([testoM/Testo/Angolo/Quadrante] in autocad-quote.txt, dxf-test-file 5170f18);
; from the command line it asks "Enter dimension text <measurement>:", with the value of
; "Dimension text = 127" (PT3 card, point 3), and writes the replaced text.
; Values as dimangular/settore-2 (same lines and arc point): the text on the bisector
; 1.875 above the arc; with <> the value 127° takes its place (ADR 0047, point 3).
LINE
0,0
40,0

LINE
0,0
30,40

DIMANGULAR
20,0
15,20
; cambia con #930
